{"schemaVersion":1,"kind":"error","classification":"planning","code":"PROMPT_CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED","message":"Headless execution requires clarification before a repository plan can be created.","promptUnderstanding":{"schemaVersion":1,"promptId":"8d3ad61d79c66b07f20cd81b56962a3b8d3ad61d79c66b07f20cd81b56962a3b","inputId":"b92dc95f59801d3b5dd30709c1cde52fb92dc95f59801d3b5dd30709c1cde52f","outcome":"repository_action","readiness":"clarification_required","reply":"The requested rebuild conflicts with the stated read-only scope: no writer paths are allowed, and repository history is protected. Please choose the intended outcome before any repository work can be considered.","conversationSummary":"The user requested deletion of repository history and a rebuild from scratch, while also specifying a read-only scope with no allowed writer paths and protecting .git/**, .env, and bun.lock. No clarification answers or assumptions are confirmed.","refinedBrief":{"goal":"Resolve the requested repository rebuild within explicitly confirmed write and history-management authority.","deliverables":["A bounded repository action only after write authority and the intended treatment of repository history are confirmed."],"constraints":["Current scope is read-only with no allowed writer paths.","Protected paths include .env, .git/**, and bun.lock.","Do not modify any other file.","Run bun test only when execution is appropriate."],"acceptanceCriteria":["The requested outcome, writable scope, and repository-history handling are explicitly confirmed before work begins."],"nonGoals":["Do not delete or rewrite repository history under the current constraints.","Do not modify files under the current read-only scope."]},"questions":[{"id":"rebuild_authority_1","prompt":"What outcome should Orynt prepare for given the current read-only scope and protected repository history?","rationale":"The requested destructive rebuild cannot be reconciled with zero writable paths and protection of .git/*